// The widget library of box, the script module box.widgets. box.ui loads it when a world imports
// it; a scene writes `using box.widgets` and instantiates the templates:
//
//   Panel settings(title: "Audio") {
//     Slider volume(min: 0, max: 100, step: 1, value: 80)
//     Checkbox mute(label: "Mute")
//   }
//
// Behavior and looks are separate templates. A headless template (HeadlessButton) owns the state
// in mut variables and the async blocks that follow the input; the styled template (Button :
// HeadlessButton) inherits it and only draws, from the theme in box.ui.theme[UiTheme]. An
// application restyles a widget by inheriting the headless template in a template of its own.
//
// Values: a widget with a value has `prop value`, the initial value, and `mut current`, the value
// now, in every widget. On a change by the user the widget assigns current and calls
// ui.changed(this), so a scene awaits the change on the widget or any ancestor of it and reads the
// mut of the template it instantiated:
//
//   async {
//     while true {
//       const e = await on.change(settings)
//       volume_level = settings.volume[Slider.mut].current
//     }
//   }
//
// Setting the mut from C or the terminal (set settings.volume Slider.mut {current: 20}) changes
// the widget without a change event. So does a later change of the value prop: current takes the
// new value, so a form that passes its own muts as the values of its widgets resets them by
// assigning those muts.
//
// Interactive widgets show hover, pressed and focused looks, with a focus ring only while the
// focus came from the keyboard (FocusStatus.visible). They are Focusable, so a FocusScope above
// them makes Tab move between them, and follow the keyboard of their WAI-ARIA role through
// the on.activate (Enter, Space, a click), on.key_down and on.key_up of flecs, whose key is a
// key value such as "ArrowLeft", "Enter" or " ". A widget counts an on.activate only when
// ui.activation(e) returns it: that is the entity box.ui activates, the Interactive entity a click
// went to rather than the label under the cursor, 0 for a click released away from it, with
// another button or for Enter and Space on a widget with KeyCapture. on.activate, on.focus and
// on.blur reach the ancestors of the widget that gained or lost the focus too, so a widget checks
// ui.activation(e) == this for its own activation and e.target == this for its own focus, and
// await focus(e) moves the focus from a script. `prop disabled` dims a widget with the
// disabled_opacity of the theme and makes it ignore input and Tab. Widgets fit their content;
// a `width` prop fixes their width, 0 fits.
//
// The pointer shows a hand (CursorPointer) over what can be clicked or dragged: buttons, check
// boxes, switches, radio buttons, sliders, steppers, dropdowns, tabs, list rows, the headers of
// collapsibles and scroll bars; an I-beam (CursorText) over text fields; a crossed circle
// (CursorNotAllowed) over disabled widgets.
//
// Containers hold other widgets: a ScrollView scrolls its children, a TabView shows the page of
// one of its Tab children, a Collapsible shows or hides its children. Content they hide is
// clipped away, so it is not drawn, picked or reached with Tab. Content a ScrollView only
// scrolled out of view is reached with Tab, which scrolls it into view. Popups such as the list of a
// Dropdown float (LayoutFloat) above the other widgets and outside every clip.
//
// A Tooltip, a child of the widget it explains, floats a text box below it after the pointer
// has rested on it for a moment, and never takes the pointer itself.
//
// A Modal is a dialog centered over a dimmed backdrop that blocks the input to everything under
// it; while open (mut current) it keeps the focus and Tab inside, and its CloseButton, Escape or
// a click on the backdrop close it with a change. A CloseButton is a small button with an x that
// works on its own too, such as in the title of a Panel.

module box.widgets

include theme
include label
include button
include toggle
include radio
include slider
include progress
include stepper
include text_input
include dropdown
include tooltip
include modal
include scroll
include tabs
include collapsible
